
            	<h3><u>Jannat hai karbala</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Hussain hussain hussain..(4)<br />
Aate hai zaereen karbobala<br />
haatho&#39;n me leke mishaale wafa<br />
maatami hai ab yaume wila<br />
kaale libaas aur shaale azaa<br />
lab pe sajaye hue ye sadaa</p>

<p>jannat hai roza tera, jannat hai puri ye karbobala<br />
ae wallah ae wallah husaina</p>

<p>Rasulallah(s.a.w.w.) farmate hai:&nbsp;<br />
&quot;Karbala ki zameen, jannat ke teelo&#39;n me se ek teela hai.&quot;</p>

<p>karbala jannat hai karbala, wallah<br />
karbala jannat hai karbala<br />
salam husain ya husaina..(2), yabn-ar-rasool ya husaina<br />
salam husain ya husaina..(2), yabn-az-zahra ya husaina</p>

<p>1. Aaye ziyarat ko hum, ae wallah<br />
khaate hai teri qasam, ae wallah<br />
matam ye hoga na kam, ae wallah<br />
aankhein rahegi ye nam, ae wallah</p>

<p>Imam Jafare Sadiq (a.s.) farmate hai:&nbsp;<br />
&quot; Jis shakhs ko allah khair ataa karna chahta hai uske dil me qabre imam hussain ki shauq daalta hai&quot;</p>

<p>2. Shauqe ziyarat jo tha, ae wallah<br />
maula mai paidal chala, ae wallah<br />
khwab ye pura hua, ae wallah<br />
dekha haram to kaha, ae wallah</p>

<p>3. Pani tere shehr ka, ae wallah<br />
kausar se meetha laga, ae wallah<br />
uski hawa hai dawa, ae wallah<br />
khaak hai khaak e shifa, ae wallah</p>

<p>4. Jaaye jahan bhi nazar, ae wallah<br />
aaye nazar sar hi sar, ae wallah<br />
qudsi wali ya bashar, ae wallah<br />
hai ye sadaa humsafar, ae wallah</p>

<p>Jab hum bainul harmain pohochte hai&nbsp;<br />
to jaagta hai dil me ye ehsaas<br />
ek taraf roza e hussain ek taraf roza e abbas<br />
ye jannat nahi to aur kya hai<br />
Bainul haramain..(4)</p>

<p>5. Ek taraf darr tera, ae wallah<br />
ek taraf bawafa, ae wallah<br />
do jannato ki hawa, ae wallah<br />
ashk huwe lab kusha, ae wallah</p>

<p>6. Roze ka husn hai kya, ae wallah<br />
gumbad arsh e khuda, ae wallah<br />
fanoos &nbsp;shams uz zoha, ae wallah<br />
meenar auj e wafa, ae wallah<br />
aaraish e bamodarr, ae wallah<br />
seera ho jisse nazar, ae wallah<br />
nazm hai deewar par, ae wallah<br />
jaise ke shams o qamar, ae wallah</p>

<p>Haaye qateel e jafaa<br />
tu yaha pyaasa raha<br />
mujhko sare karbala<br />
koi na pyaasa mila..(2)</p>

<p>7. Ae mere tashna dahan, ae wallah<br />
tu to raha be kafan, ae wallah<br />
jaate hai log watan, ae wallah<br />
leke yahan se kafan, ae wallah</p>

<p>8. Haaye shah e karbala<br />
Haaye qateel e jafaa<br />
zaero pe tere ek wo waqt tha<br />
haath payro&#39;n ko katwa ke bhi ba khuda<br />
tere roze pe aate the ehle azaa</p>

<p>8. Tujh pe fida kardiye, ae wallah<br />
maao&#39;n ne haste huwe, ae wallah<br />
ghar me the jitne diye, ae wallah<br />
bus yahi kehte huwe, ae wallah</p>

<p>9. Farhan o mazhar kaho, ae wallah<br />
duniya ko paigham do, ae wallah<br />
roza e sheh pe chalo, ae wallah<br />
aur yahi kehte raho, ae wallah</p>

<p>jannat hai roza tera, jannat hai puri ye karbobala<br />
ae wallah ae wallah husaina<br />
karbala jannat hai karbala, wallah<br />
karbala jannat hai karbala<br />
salam husain ya husaina..(2), yabn-ar-rasool ya husaina<br />
salam husain ya husaina..(2), yabn-az-zahra ya husaina</p>

<p>Hussain hussain hussain..(2)</p>
</p>
